  "dek": "The public leader remains at 88.06, but the provisional gold cutoff climbed to 40.83 as contenders advanced below the top four.",
  "discord": "**The ARC Daily Digest · Late edition | ARC-AGI-2**\nTufa Labs holds the public lead at 88.06, with rabbithole, Yi-Chia Chen and nvbanana next. The provisional gold cutoff rose from 38.61 to 40.83 since yesterday’s Eastern evening close; D Chakraborty climbed to 18th. The story also covers Tufa’s own account of its ARC-2 effort, without treating a public score as a final prize result.\nhttps://arc.markbarney.net/news/2026-10-10-evening-arc-2",
