  "sections": [
    {
      "heading": "The lead holds",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board",
        "social-2108578092558250148",
        "person-dries-smit-identity-0",
        "person-dries-smit-roster-0",
        "person-dries-smit-archive-0"
      ],
      "text": "Tufa Labs remains first on the ARC-AGI-2 public board at 88.06, unchanged from the previous Eastern evening close. rabbithole is second at 80.56, Yi-Chia Chen third at 77.22 and nvbanana fourth at 77.08. ARC Prize announced Tufa’s public high yesterday; neither this board nor that announcement establishes the private result or a final prize award. Dries Smit is a verified member of the Tufa Labs roster in this contest; ARC Prize separately credits him with leading the winning 2025 ARC-AGI-3 Preview agent."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Pressure below the leaders",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board"
      ],
      "text": "The provisional gold cutoff increased from 38.61 at the previous evening close to 40.83. D Chakraborty advanced from 23rd to 18th, improving from 34.86 to 37.92 across the observed comparison. Khaotic Sethesis reached ninth at 48.75 after a recorded score event; its prior-evening comparison is unavailable. ARC Raiders remains seventh at 58.75."
    },
    {
      "heading": "People across the contests",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board",
        "person-jean-francois-puget-identity-0",
        "person-jean-francois-puget-roster-0",
        "person-jean-francois-puget-roster-1",
        "person-jack-cole-roster-0",
        "person-mithil-a-vakde-roster-0",
        "person-dries-smit-roster-0",
        "person-dries-smit-roster-1"
      ],
      "text": "Jean-François Puget’s verified cpmpml account is listed with nvbanana here and NVARC3 in ARC-AGI-3, under separate team IDs. Jack Cole is 17th at 38.61, and Mithil A Vakde is 32nd at 33.89. Tufa Labs’ roster includes Dries Smit in both contests, but the team’s ARC-AGI-2 entry is distinct from its ARC-AGI-3 entry. These roster observations establish listed membership, not when anyone joined or who made a submission."
    },
    {
      "heading": "A word from Tufa",
      "sourceIds": [
        "social-2108916273937858887",
        "social-2108584791436321097",
        "board"
      ],
      "text": "Replying in the organizer’s bonus-threshold thread, Tufa Labs said its ARC-AGI-2 effort began by accident and promised more information after the deadline. That is the team’s account, with no method disclosed. The public standings remain provisional while the competition continues."
    }
